{"id":"613210805","kind":"article","title":"赞助人模式在何种程度上可以资助思想工具的创作？","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7yW6uFDGHgKUruzdj7Le6GNRkvm2b7Db313c"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2023-03-12","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":5,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":329,"keywords":["思想工具","赞助人模式","公共物品","哈伯格税制"],"summary":"这则译介提出，用户界面创意具有公共物品属性，因而商业投资思想工具的动力有限；作者把赞助人模式视为小范围内可能的替代方案，并提出需要进一步考察它的适用范围与设计方式。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/613210805","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"gg4QdGbE\">由于<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zXseK39g1SHgQvMXLbnaB1AUZ2WL5ffDzsbZ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">用户界面的新颖创意是公共物品</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，所以对<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5YhNc8HVKxjg9a3h3SeCyKqnNDFgiY6WGrM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">思想工具</a>的商业投资动机不强。至少在小范围来说，赞助人模式可能是一种有前景的备选模式。那么赞助人在多大范围上奏效？如何最优地利用这一模式？</p><ul><li data-pid=\"i79yhRgy\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5Q2U1CQMkxzDTgkm3ez5sRCRJFw1TbDnyD3y\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">赞助人是为未来作品买单</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"FKwfDFPr\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zBz53uF3VUGYkxXfR3GvboCC7Tj2ctQPLEY\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">基于哈伯格税制的赞助人模式可以创造利润刺激</a><br/> </li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"FfsiGJ1n\">暂无</li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"WqL_T9g6\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 <span class=\"nolink\">Lucas-Tsui</span>、校对 Shom<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7yW6uFDGHgKUruzdj7Le6GNRkvm2b7Db313c\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">To what extent can patronage fund the creation of tools for thought? (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 新颖的用户界面创意是公共物品 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"642001483\" href=\"#/post/642001483\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"613210251","title":"我不知道如何高效支配大额资本来为思想工具的研究服务","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"613210988","title":"二次方募资在何种程度上可以资助思维工具的创作？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":3,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"642001483","title":"新颖的用户界面创意是公共物品","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}